# Synthetic UI fixture: deterministic, regenerable via
# `uv run python -m forecast.make_fixture --out data/forecast.fixture.json`.
# No pytest depends on this file existing on disk (tests build it in-memory or
# under tmp_path); scripts/f5_payload_swap.sh regenerates it on demand for
# manual browser probes. Not committed to avoid a second, driftable copy.
data/forecast.fixture.json
